network.py adapts the released ScoreModelFC_Adv architecture and timestep
embedding from lib/algorithms/advanced/model.py for frozen, null-conditioned
evaluation only. Unused imports, training masks and unsupported model options
are removed; checkpoint tensor names and evaluation arithmetic are preserved.
teacher.py implements strict EMA restoration and the released subVP score wrapper.
No upstream checkpoint weights are distributed with this source.
